Subject: [PATCH] Track Wine kernel pool tags and implement SystemPoolTagInformation.

Track real ExAllocatePool allocations through the wineserver, including frees
and process exit. Expose paged/nonpaged counts and outstanding allocation bytes.
Windows Server 2022 reference establishes minimum-size and NULL-buffer behavior.
WoW64 query conversion and restricted-token policy remain unimplemented.

--- a/include/winternl.h
+++ b/include/winternl.h
@@ -3017,6 +3017,24 @@
